  "finding": "The added Click action and corrected fixture value were present, but UIA still reported supports_invoke=false. The pinned AccessKit Consumer defines a node as invocable only when clickable and with no expanded, toggle, or selected state; set_expanded(false) supplies an expanded state. The pinned Windows adapter derives InvokePattern from this invocable predicate and does not provide ExpandCollapsePattern.",
  "correction": "Keep Action::Click and HasPopup::Menu. Clear the expanded attribute while the menu is closed so UIA can expose InvokePattern; set expanded=true only while the popup is open. Verify the action and full selection flow on exact-SHA GitHub Actions.",
